## Notes: Calls out what to press when the boss timeline says an ability is coming. All specs.
## Author: NaowhUI
## Version: 1.0.0
## Dependencies: EllesmereUI
## OptionalDeps: NaowhUI_EUI, NaowhUI_Media
## SavedVariables: NaowhUITankReminderDB
## Group: NaowhUI

# Core first: it owns the DB and the settings-page injection the feature file hangs off.
# NaowhUI_EUI is optional -- with it we add a section to the existing NaowhUI group, without
# it we register that group ourselves, so this addon stands alone on EllesmereUI.
NaowhUI_TankReminder_Core.lua

# Tank busters Blizzard's own TankRole bit does not carry. Additive to it, never a
# replacement, so content this file has never heard of still works unchanged. Loads after
# Core, which owns the namespace it hangs off.
NaowhUI_TankReminder_Abilities.lua

NaowhUI_TankReminder.lua

# Reads this season's bosses and their tank-flagged abilities out of the player's own
# Dungeon Journal. Lazy: nothing is read until the page is opened.
NaowhUI_TankReminder_Bosses.lua
